OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill to raise Robert Hamill
OL,4,Areport with PSNI chief constable
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister has said the Robert
OL,7,FHamill report highlighted a "catalogue
OL,8,Fof failings, omissions and errors", and
OL,9,Fshe intends to raise it with the Police
OL,10,FService of Northern Ireland's (PSNI)
OL,11,Fchief constable.
OL,13,FAn inquiry into the sectarian murder of
OL,14,FHamill, published on Monday, found
OL,15,Fpolice officers who were in a vehicle
OL,16,Fnear the attack did not condone or
OL,17,Fcollude with the attackers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
