OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill to raise Robert Hamill
OL,4,Areport with PSNI chief constable
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the inquiry said there were
OL,7,Fmultiple police failings in the
OL,8,Finvestigation, including a tip-off to a
OL,9,Fsuspect to destroy the clothing he wore
OL,10,Fthat night.
OL,12,FRobert Hamill was 25 when he died after
OL,13,Fhe was beaten by loyalists in
OL,14,FPortadown, County Armagh, in 1997.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
